---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="home-booking" id="book-a-call" aria-labelledby="booking-title">
 <div class="booking-intro"><p class="label">Let’s meet / Book with AMI</p><h2 id="booking-title">What are you<br/>working on?</h2><p>You don’t need a finished plan to start a conversation. Choose the kind of support you’re looking for, then pick a time on our calendar.</p></div>
 <div class="booking-options"><a href="https://calendly.com/azmicrocredit/consulting" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="option-meta">Free consulting</span><h3>I could use a<br/>thinking partner.</h3><p>Talk through a business challenge with our team.</p><span class="booking-action">Book a free consultation <b aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></b></span></a><a href="https://calendly.com/azmicrocredit/loans" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="option-meta">Microloans</span><h3>I’m ready for<br/>my next investment.</h3><p>Explore funding for your business’s next step.</p><span class="booking-action">Book a loan interest meeting <b aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></b></span></a><p class="booking-note">Calendly opens in a new tab. Can’t find a time? <a href="mailto:info@azmicrocredit.org">Email our team.</a></p></div>
</section>
<style>
.home-booking{padding:90px 4.2vw;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;gap:7vw;background:#111;color:white}.label,.option-meta{font:var(--text-label)/1.6 var(--font-heading);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}.booking-intro h2{font:500 var(--text-display)/1.02 var(--font-heading);letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:32px 0}.booking-intro>p:last-child{font:var(--text-body)/1.7 var(--font-body);color:#bbb;max-width:390px}.booking-options>a{display:block;padding:30px 0;text-decoration:none;border-top:1px solid #777;position:relative}.option-meta{color:var(--green)}.booking-options h3{font:400 var(--text-heading)/1.08 var(--font-heading);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:22px 0 16px;transition:transform .25s}.booking-options>a:hover h3{transform:translateX(12px);color:var(--green)}.booking-options>a>p{font:var(--text-body)/1.6 var(--font-body);color:#ccc}.booking-action{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:25px;font:var(--text-label)/1.5 var(--font-heading)}.booking-action b{font-size:var(--text-heading);font-weight:400}.booking-note{border-top:1px solid #777;padding-top:25px;font:var(--text-label)/1.7 var(--font-heading);color:#aaa}@media(max-width:750px){.home-booking{padding:60px 22px;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}.booking-intro h2{margin:24px 0}.booking-options>a{padding:28px 0}}
</style>
